{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415671","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415671","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041567101:1":{"text":"새로 자라난 나무는 어떻게 돌보면 좋을까요?","source_cn":"新生的树该怎么照顾呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D8867C944543BA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567102:1":{"text":"황혼의 나무와 형제인 나무라면 미샤르테의 가호를 받아 잘 자랄 겁니다.","source_cn":"毕竟是流荧树的兄弟之树，有弥萨忒的伟力，应该不会有什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CF1C88DCAAD0EB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567103:1":{"text":"그렇지만 셀로클랜드는 지하에 있고, 이 나무는 원래 지상에서 자라지 않습니까.","source_cn":"话是这么说，但毕竟萨洛克兰是地底，那还是一棵地面上的树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1C21BC30E091DAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567104:1":{"text":"정원사들도 이런 식물을 길러보는 건 처음이라 어찌할 바를 모르고 있습니다.","source_cn":"原本的园丁们都束手无策，毕竟他们也没照顾过这种植物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB06FF3DCFCA18D62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567105:1":{"text":"물은 사람의 힘으로 줄 수 있지만, 빛과 바람은 어떻게 할 수 없는 것이니까요.","source_cn":"降水姑且还能用人力弥补，但是光照和通风就没法保证了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x831249CB8023BD77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041567106:1":{"text":"걱정 마십시오, 인듀어. 이건 미샤르테의 은총을 받은 나무입니다. 분명 황혼의 나무처럼 잘 자랄 거예요.","source_cn":"不用担心，因度厄，作为弥萨忒的恩赐，它一定会像流荧树一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC7FBD4790940BBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041567107:1":{"text":"그럼 미샤르테께서 잘 지켜주시기를...","source_cn":"只能祈祷弥萨忒保佑吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x902E5A4A8FF77B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041567108:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 며칠 전에 누가 나무 앞에 제물을 바쳤다고 합니다.","source_cn":"说到保佑，前些日子，听说已经有人在树前面摆祭品了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75168970AACEA418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041567109:1":{"text":"...땅거미 숲에서도 종종 있는 일이지요.","source_cn":"……这个在薄暮丛林也有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B009D29364CD93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041567110:1":{"text":"영혼의 언덕에도 사슴 영혼 조각상 앞에 화환이나 음식을 올려두곤 하니까요.","source_cn":"在鹿灵圣丘，也会有人在鹿灵雕像前摆花环和食物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22619BBB141193EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041567111:1":{"text":"덕분에 라이카와 브라이언이 종종 사람을 보내서 정리합니다.","source_cn":"莱卡和布莱恩经常需要安排人去清理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD124C2657A105A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041567112:1":{"text":"꽃이나 음식이면 다행이지요. 셀로클랜드에서는 동전을 던지는 사람도 있더군요.","source_cn":"如果只是花朵和食物倒也好办，萨洛克兰有人往树前面丢硬币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67535653D89E0C59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041567113:1":{"text":"지상에서는 이렇게 제사를 지낸다면서요? 동전을 던지면 소원이 이뤄진다고요.","source_cn":"说是从地面上学到的祭祀方式，丢一枚硬币就可以心愿成真。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ED270F7D075AF52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041567114:1":{"text":"...그건 그냥 소원을 비는 것인데요...","source_cn":"……那只是在许愿吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40F017A64461C0EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}